              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitogos anyun Horam laitoriatab Geser kolen kotoret Lakis; ak kibar Josua inendet koboto bikyik, kot ko ma bagakyi agot agenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
